\eqn{x_{t-1}} after subtracting \eqn{(\sigma_{ue}/\sigma_e\omega)(x_t - \rho x_{t-1})},
with the Phillips-Perron-type correction \eqn{\tfrac{T}{2}(\sigma_{ue}/\sigma_e\omega)(\omega^2 - \sigma_v^2)}
